title: Limit encoded CID length in Bitswap RPC requests
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The Bitswap RPC checks the 512-byte limit on each encoded CID before decoding it.
    Get requests with an oversized CID return `-32602`. Streams report the same error for
    the oversized item and continue processing the remaining CIDs.
crates:
- name: sc-rpc-spec-v2
  bump: patch
